ition`/`updateRiskCondition` have no caller: re-grep `backend scripts static __tests__` with a control). (f) The red-flag setting: `git diff origin/main..origin/b835` contains no line with `red_flag` or `redFlag` (control: planted), `backend/server.js:20638` and `:20659-20665` are byte-identical at both ends (`cmp` of the extracted ranges), and the Settings page values (`static/settings.html` red-flag select) are not in the diff.
