ct statement (rule family insecure/injection/sanitisation on `server.js` lines 21237-21239), that is the hand-up: STOP with the one question.** You never dismiss, never re-run, never touch the ruleset. State for Tuesday: closure of anything is read after a merge by number (C-209); this PR adds no sink, so the expected PR-ref result is 0 new alerts, which is a prediction to write BEFORE the final read and not a finding.
